    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On March 31, 2024, the Government of Sindh announced the names of the 646 teachers who successfully cleared Pakistan's first Teaching License Test, held on January 28, 2024, under the recently approved Sindh Teaching License Policy 2023. This milestone marks a significant step forward in improving the professionalism and status of teachers in Sindh, ultimately leading to enhanced learning outcomes for students. The test saw the participation of 4,000 teachers from both government and private sectors.",
